      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Worth a note: one proposed fix that would likely work consistently is to instead replace the path fetch at `Packages/com.vrchat.worlds/Integrations/ClientSim/Runtime/Helpers/ClientSimStationHelper.cs` for `StationGraph.asset` with the call\n\n`UnityEditor.AssetDatabase.GUIDToAssetPath(\"4715e20276be3b141a6a216230cab4e9\")`\n\nto get the asset path regardless.\n\nOtherwise, my quick fix was to use\n\n`Path.Combine(\"Packages\", \"com.vrchat.worlds\", \"Samples\", \"UdonExampleScene\", \"Prefabs\", \"VRCChair\", \"StationGraph.asset\");`\n\nbut I assume here the GUID won't change, so the GUID is probably more stable.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
